			<br />
			<span style="font-size:10.0pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please see below details of an AWB that requires action. We have provided all the key information from&nbsp;our&nbsp;investigation below. Could you refer to the&nbsp;<b>Action Required</b> section and provide CSU with an update.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
